cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use xgt in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "xgt: a command-line interface for the Genome Taxonomy Database with cross-release taxonomic comparison"
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ebedthan/xgt"
url: "https://github.com/Ebedthan/xgt"
abstract: >
  xgt is a command-line tool for querying the Genome Taxonomy Database
  (GTDB) REST API. It provides batch search, genome card retrieval,
  taxon lineage exploration, and cross-release taxonomic comparison
  via the diff subcommand, with support for JSON, CSV, and TSV output,
  parallel pagination, a transparent local response cache, and no
  runtime dependencies.
